OL,5,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FAs the United States prepared for
OL,7,     Fthe invasion of the Philippines,
OL,8,     Fscheduled for late 1944, the tiny
OL,9,     FPalau Islands had to be taken
OL,10,     Ffirst.
OL,11,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
